## Proposed Changes

### Backend Fixes

#### [MODIFY] `backend/app/api/v1/cycles.py`
- **Fix 500 Error**: The `@require_roles` decorator requires the endpoint signature to include `request: Request`. I will add this to `update_cycle` so the cycle active toggle stops throwing 500 errors.

#### [MODIFY] `backend/app/api/v1/users.py`
- **Demo Create User**: Add a `POST /demo-create` endpoint to insert a user directly into the database without touching Supabase Auth, satisfying the UI requirement for the demo.

